{"id":"n62333-5-8","stage":2,"title":"쏟다 · 倾","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62333-5-8-1","ko":"하늘을 보니 곧 비가 오겠네.","zh":"看看天空，好像马上要下雨了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하늘을","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오겠네.","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3d5cbea42f5159581d8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62333-5-8-2","ko":"응, 한바탕 비가 쏟겠는걸.","zh":"嗯，肯定会下一场大雨呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한바탕","meaning":"一场，一阵儿，一番","explanation":"한바탕：一场，一阵儿，一番","readings":[{"term":"한바탕","audio":"/audio/6da0fcbd74ec77f1c16c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84899","senseId":"1","lemma":"한바탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쏟겠는걸.","meaning":"倾，倾斜","explanation":"쏟다：倾，倾斜；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"쏟다","audio":"/audio/d31ee289987baedde891.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62333","senseId":"5","lemma":"쏟다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6da0fcbd74ec77f1","term":"한바탕","zh":"一场，一阵儿，一番","audio":"/audio/6da0fcbd74ec77f1c16c.mp3","entryId":"84899","definition":"大大地一次。","pronunciation":["한바탕"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"d31ee289987baedd","term":"쏟다","zh":"倾，倾斜","audio":"/audio/d31ee289987baedde891.mp3","entryId":"62333","definition":"阳光强烈地照射或雪或雨一次下得很多。","pronunciation":["쏟따"]}],"audio":"/audio/880bc2caae1ca8490156.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.378,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62333","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"중급","day":76,"sequenceScore":2.1033,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，肯定会下一场大雨呢。","花已经开始凋谢了呢。","看看天空，好像马上要下雨了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，肯定会下一场大雨呢。","看看天空，好像马上要下雨了。","花已经开始凋谢了呢。"],"answer":0}]}
